#  Sample conditions  #
#######################

save_conditions_1
   _Saveframe_category   sample_conditions

   _Details             
;
crystallized with  
20mM citrate buffer pH 4, 
60% 2-methyl-2,4-pentanediol (MPD).
Igumenova et al.,
J. Am. Chem. Soc. 126, 6720 (2004)
;

   loop_
      _Variable_type
      _Variable_value
      _Variable_value_error
      _Variable_value_units

      pH            4 1 pH 
      temperature 268 5 K  

   stop_

save_


